// Authored for def_parse_weapons (fixtures/README.md): the weapon blocks its pins read, each
// holding only the keys the test reads, in the grammar JO's weapon.def is written in (tabs and
// runs of blanks between a key and its values, comma-separated pos/tpos triples, a key's case
// as JO spells it, a trailing word after a value). Each pinned value is the test's witnessed
// pin; every other number is ours.

